# AUDIT 6 (2026-09-29): THE RECORD THE SERVICE READS AT REQUEST TIME MUST SHIP. Every `*.md` was
# excluded, and these four are opened by deployed code, package-relative: `research_log.py`
# (the live trial count and the HLZ hurdle on /proof; the whole /work/research page, which
# rendered "0 entries" in production), `index_track.gate_state` (the operational gate on
# /api/index-track, which reported the contract "not readable"), and `research_record.py`
# (the pre-registration list). Measured on valquo.co 2026-09-29. The DECL_*.md case was solved
# earlier by shipping a manifest (test_fleet_manifest.py); these are read as markdown and have
# no manifest, so they ship as themselves. Handoffs, CLAUDE.md and the audits stay out.
!RESEARCH_LOG.md
!PAPER_TRACK_CONTRACT.md
!VALQUO_EXTENSIONS.md
!PREREG_*.md
